    {
      "fieldname": "instructions_html",
      "fieldtype": "HTML",
      "label": "Instructions",
      "options": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n<h6><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i> VIP Import - Volunteer Information Portal</h6>\n<p>This tool imports volunteer data from VIP (Volunteer Information Portal) CSV exports.</p>\n<p><b>Expected Columns:</b> id, google_account_ref, nvv_relatie_nummer, email, private_email, first_name, last_name, phone_number, mobile_number, date_joined, status, notes, status_notes, is_delegated_account</p>\n<p><b>Matching Logic:</b> Members are matched by nvv_relatie_nummer (member_id), then by private_email, then by organization email.</p>\n<p><b>Status Mapping:</b> available → Active, holiday/break → Inactive, unavailable/quit → Retired</p>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "fieldname": "file_section",
      "fieldtype": "Section Break",
      "label": "File Upload"
    },
    {
      "fieldname": "naming_series",
      "fieldtype": "Select",
      "label": "Series",
      "options": "VIP-IMPORT-.YYYY.-",
      "reqd": 1
    },
    {
      "description": "Upload your VIP export CSV or Excel file",
      "fieldname": "csv_file",
      "fieldtype": "Attach",
      "label": "CSV/Excel File",
      "reqd": 1
    },
    {
      "default": "utf-8",
      "fieldname": "encoding",
      "fieldtype": "Select",
      "label": "File Encoding",
      "options": "utf-8\nutf-8-sig\niso-8859-1\nwindows-1252",
      "reqd": 1
    },
    {
      "fieldname": "column_break_file",
      "fieldtype": "Column Break"
    },
    {
      "allow_on_submit": 1,
      "fieldname": "import_status",
